{"id":2639,"title":{"romaji":"Shinzou Ningen Casshern","english":"Neo Human Casshan","native":"新造人間キャシャーン"},"slug":"shinzou_ningen_casshern","synopsis":"The brilliant Dr. Azuma created many robots to aid humankind. However, during a thunderstorm his lab was struck by lightning, corrupting the programming of one of his robots, BK-1, who renames himself Braiking Boss and declares that instead of serving mankind, mankind will now serve him!  He brings other robots together into an overwhelming army bent on enslaving the human race. \n\nTetsuya, Dr. Azuma's son, asks his father to turn him into an indestructible android so that he will have the power to destroy the threat his father inadvertently created. Shortly thereafter, Braiking Boss captures Dr. Azuma and his wife,  Tetsuya, now renamed Casshern, sets out to turn the tide of the war and rescue his parents, with the help of his girlfriend, Luna, and robot dog, Friender. ","format":"TV","season":"FALL","year":1973,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:35","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 07:53:51","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":4810},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":4810},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":3799},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":1561},{"site":"ANN","externalId":2174},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":3854},{"site":"HIDIVE","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":5265,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/AbuUYHzA4PGr7IiSJYzgiIYNw4uuTB9AMARNWaEn.png"},{"id":5266,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/uZkM971QjkmFoxXos02IaYPDDCgmwhmOnFVUZJzD.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":47,"name":"Tatsunoko Production","slug":"tatsunoko_production"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":602,"name":"Casshern","slug":"casshern"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":138,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":138,"title":{"romaji":"Tatakae! Casshan","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":148,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":12425,"basename":"ShinzouNingenCass